                                "sense_id": "d2c39b1f-3d96-3fcd-9001-4dca826df958",
                                "text": "During the last two centuries men appear to have striven, with a most uncommendable zeal, all over Christendom, to root out and extirpate every trace of the Gothic."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7a5b6578-0792-4cfa-ad78-178f8300a2cc",
                                "sense_id": "d2c39b1f-3d96-3fcd-9001-4dca826df958",
                                "text": "He arrived at the Eighty-second Street apartment about six o'clock in the evening, and, after studying the dingy name-plates, took the five flights of stairs with uncommendable speed, and presented himself at the rear door on the sixth floor."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
